### Learning Service 练习和题目管理接口测试
### 注意：请确保数据库中有课程ID为1的课程和班级ID为1的班级
### 调试说明：如果获取题目列表返回null，可能的原因：
### 1. 数据库中没有题目数据
### 2. QuestionServiceImpl的getAllQuestions()或getQuestionListByCourse()方法有问题
### 3. QuestionMapper的SQL查询有问题
### 建议先执行创建题目的测试，然后再测试获取列表
### 
### 微服务说明：
### - 收藏和错题列表返回的数据只包含learning-service内的字段（如course_id, section_id）
### - 如需课程名称、章节名称，需要调用course-service的API
### - 这是微服务架构的正常设计，避免跨服务数据库查询

### 题目管理测试 (QuestionController)

### 1. 创建题目 - 单选题
# 预期响应：{"code": 200, "message": "题目创建成功", "data": 题目ID}

POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1001

{
  "type": "singlechoice",
  "content": "以下哪个关键字用于定义Java类？",
  "optionsList": ["class", "interface", "abstract", "public"],
  "answer": "class",
  "analysis": "class关键字用于定义Java类",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}

### 2. 创建题目 - 编程题
# 预期响应：{"code": 200, "message": "题目创建成功", "data": 题目ID}
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1001

{
  "type": "program",
  "content": "请编写一个Java程序，实现计算两个整数的和",
  "answer": "public class Sum { public static int add(int a, int b) { return a + b; } }",
  "analysis": "这是一个简单的加法函数实现",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}

### 2.1. 创建题目 - 多选题
# 预期响应：{"code": 200, "message": "题目创建成功", "data": 题目ID}

POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1001

{
  "type": "multiplechoice",
  "content": "以下哪些是Java的基本数据类型？",
  "optionsList": ["int", "String", "double", "boolean"],
  "answer": "int,double,boolean",
  "analysis": "int、double、boolean是Java基本数据类型，String是引用类型",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}

### 2.2. 创建题目 - 另一个单选题
# 预期响应：{"code": 200, "message": "题目创建成功", "data": 题目ID}
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1001

{
  "type": "singlechoice",
  "content": "以下哪个是Java的基本数据类型？",
  "optionsList": ["int", "String", "ArrayList", "HashMap"],
  "answer": "int",
  "analysis": "int是Java的基本数据类型，其他都是引用类型",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}

### 3. 创建题目 - 判断题
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1001

{
  "type": "judge",
  "content": "Java是一种面向对象的编程语言",
  "answer": "true",
  "analysis": "Java确实是面向对象的编程语言",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}

### 4. 创建题目 - 填空题
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1001

{
  "type": "fillblank",
  "content": "Java程序的入口方法是____",
  "answer": "main",
  "analysis": "Java程序的入口方法是main方法",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}

### 5. 获取所有题目列表 (调试：检查是否有数据返回)
# 预期响应：{"code": 200, "message": "获取题目列表成功", "data": [题目列表]}
# 如果返回data为null或空数组，说明数据库中没有题目或查询有问题
GET http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question/list

### 6. 根据课程ID获取题目列表
# 预期响应：{"code": 200, "message": "获取题目列表成功", "data": [课程相关题目列表]}
GET http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question/list?courseId=1

### 7. 获取题目详情
# 预期响应：{"code": 200, "message": "获取题目详情成功", "data": 题目详情对象}
GET http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question/1

### 8. 更新题目
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "singlechoice",
  "content": "以下哪个关键字用于定义Java类？（更新版）",
  "optionsList": ["class", "interface", "abstract", "public"],
  "answer": "class",
  "analysis": "class关键字用于定义Java类（更新版说明）",
  "courseId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}

### 练习管理测试 (PracticeController)

### 9. 创建练习
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1001

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "classId": 1,
  "title": "Java基础语法练习",
  "startTime": "2024-08-30T09:00:00",
  "endTime": "2024-08-30T11:00:00",
  "allowMultipleSubmission": true
}

### 10. 获取班级练习列表
GET http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/class/1

### 11. 获取练习详情
GET http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/1

### 12. 更新练习
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "classId": 1,
  "title": "Java基础语法练习（更新版）",
  "startTime": "2024-08-30T09:30:00",
  "endTime": "2024-08-30T11:30:00",
  "allowMultipleSubmission": false
}

### 13. 添加题目到练习
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/1/questions/1?score=10

### 14. 添加多个题目到练习
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/1/questions/2?score=15

### 15. 添加更多题目到练习
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/1/questions/4?score=5

### 16. 获取练习的题目列表
GET http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/1/questions

### 17. 从练习中移除题目
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/learning/practice/1/questions/4

### 18. 批量导入题目到练习
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/question/import-to-practice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "practiceId": 1,
  "questionIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "scores": [10, 15, 8]
}

